      "value": "@{5f683bb45ead2a4b371e798a|full_name}: https://blog.natalie.ee/posts/building-dynamic-vrchat-world/\n\nNear the end of this, the person is sending to yt-dlp a page with a video tag instead of a 404 response. Maybe that it alternative solution.\n\nRespecting a 404 sounds like being a good netizen.",
